{title: Nations Spread Out Over the Earth}
{subtitle: Genesis 10:1–32}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 74}
{time: 6/8}

{comment: Intro (instrumental)}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [F/A] | [Gm7] |
| [Eb] | [Bb] | [F/A] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Intro}
Coastland peoples [Bb]spread out over the earth
[Eb]Shem and Ham and [Bb]Japheth
[Gm]Nations spread out o[F]ver the earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]This is the [Bb]family line of Noah
Shem [F/A]and Ham and Japheth
[Gm]Sons were born to [Eb]them after the [Cm7]flood
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Coast[F]land peoples [Bb]spread out into their lands
Each with its own [F/A]language
By their [Gm]clans within [Eb]their nations
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
From these [Bb]the nations spread out [F]over the earth
[Bb]Shem and [Bb]Ham and Japheth
Nations spread out [Eb]over the [Bb]earth
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
The sons of Ham Cush [F]Egypt Put
And [Bb]Canaan
Cush fathered Nimrod mighty on the [F/A]earth
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
He was a [Gm]mighty hunter before the [Eb]LORD
Be[Cm7]ginning of his kin[F]gdom was Ba[Bb]bel
Erech Akkad and Calneh in Shinar
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
From these [F/A]the nations spread [Gm]out over [Eb]the earth
Shem and Ham [Bb]and Japheth
Nations [F]spread out over [Bb]the earth
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
Sons were also born to Shem
[Eb]Father of all the sons of Eber
[Bb]Elam Asshur Ar[F]pachshad Lud and A[Bb]ram
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Arpachshad fa[F/A]thered Shelah [Gm]and Shelah fathered [Eb]Eber
[Cm7]Peleg named for the divid[F]ed earth
[Eb]Joktan fathered ma[F]ny sons
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
From these [Bb]the nations spread [F/A]out over the [Gm]earth
[Eb]Shem and Ham and Jap[Bb]heth
Nations spread out [F]over the [Bb]earth
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[Eb]Clans of [F]Noah sons by family [Gm]lines
With[Gm7/F]in their na[Eb]tions [F]
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
From these [Bb]the nations spread [F/A]out over the [Gm]earth
[Eb]After the [Bb][F/A]flood
{end_of_verse}

